#!/bin/sh
# GWRT DNS 急救 (gwrt-dns-rescue)
# 一键清理 DNS/代理插件退出后的残留，恢复系统默认解析：
#   1. 卸载 /etc/resolv.conf 上的劫持挂载
#   2. 恢复 /etc/resolv.conf 符号链接（dnsmasq 重启会重建内容）
#   3. 清理 dnsmasq 里指向本地死端口的插件残留（server/noresolv/resolvfile/port）
#   4. 清理把 53 端口重定向到本地死端口的 nft 规则（保留系统 DNSMASQ HIJACK）
#   5. 重启 dnsmasq 并自检解析
# 输出: JSON {"ok":bool,"actions":[...],"warnings":[...],"test":"..."}

PATH=/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin
export PATH

ACTIONS=""; WARNINGS=""; TESTMSG=""; OK=0

jesc() { printf '%s' "$1" | sed 's/\\/\\\\/g; s/"/\\"/g'; }
act() { A=$(jesc "$1"); ACTIONS="${ACTIONS:+$ACTIONS,}\"$A\""; }
wrn() { W=$(jesc "$1"); WARNINGS="${WARNINGS:+$WARNINGS,}\"$W\""; }

# ---------- 1. 卸载 resolv.conf 上的劫持挂载 ----------
n=0
while mount | grep -q ' on /etc/resolv.conf '; do
	umount /etc/resolv.conf 2>/dev/null || { wrn "无法卸载 /etc/resolv.conf 挂载"; break; }
	n=$((n+1))
done
while mount | grep -q ' on /tmp/resolv.conf '; do
	umount /tmp/resolv.conf 2>/dev/null || break
	n=$((n+1))
done
[ "$n" -gt 0 ] && act "卸载了 $n 层 resolv.conf 劫持挂载"

# ---------- 2. 恢复 /etc/resolv.conf 符号链接 ----------
if [ ! -L /etc/resolv.conf ] || [ "$(readlink /etc/resolv.conf 2>/dev/null)" != "/tmp/resolv.conf" ]; then
	rm -f /etc/resolv.conf 2>/dev/null
	ln -s /tmp/resolv.conf /etc/resolv.conf 2>/dev/null && act "恢复 /etc/resolv.conf 符号链接"
fi

# ---------- 3. 清理 dnsmasq 里的插件残留 ----------
changed=0
for s in $(uci -q get dhcp.@dnsmasq[0].server 2>/dev/null); do
	case "$s" in
		127.0.0.1#*|::1#*|localhost#*)
			p="${s##*#}"
			if [ "$p" != "53" ]; then
				uci -q del_list "dhcp.@dnsmasq[0].server=$s" && { act "移除上游残留 $s"; changed=1; }
			fi
			;;
	esac
done
if [ "$(uci -q get dhcp.@dnsmasq[0].noresolv 2>/dev/null)" = "1" ]; then
	left=$(uci -q get dhcp.@dnsmasq[0].server 2>/dev/null | wc -w)
	if [ "$left" -eq 0 ]; then
		uci -q set dhcp.@dnsmasq[0].noresolv='0'
		act "关闭 noresolv（恢复 resolv.conf 上游）"
		changed=1
	fi
fi
rf=$(uci -q get dhcp.@dnsmasq[0].resolvfile 2>/dev/null)
if [ -n "$rf" ] && [ "$rf" != "/tmp/resolv.conf.d/resolv.conf.auto" ] && [ ! -e "$rf" ]; then
	uci -q set dhcp.@dnsmasq[0].resolvfile='/tmp/resolv.conf.d/resolv.conf.auto'
	act "恢复 resolvfile 默认值"
	changed=1
fi
dp=$(uci -q get dhcp.@dnsmasq[0].port 2>/dev/null)
if [ -n "$dp" ] && [ "$dp" != "53" ] && ! netstat -lnt 2>/dev/null | grep -q ':53 '; then
	uci -q delete dhcp.@dnsmasq[0].port
	act "恢复 dnsmasq 端口 53"
	changed=1
fi
[ "$changed" -eq 1 ] && uci -q commit dhcp

# ---------- 4. 清理指向本地死端口的 53 重定向 nft 规则 ----------
nft -a list ruleset 2>/dev/null | awk '
	/^table /{ fam=$2; tbl=$3 }
	/^[[:space:]]+chain /{ ch=$2 }
	/dport 53/ && (/redirect to :[0-9]+/ || /dnat to [^ ]*:[0-9]+/) {
		if (!match($0, /# handle [0-9]+/)) next
		h=substr($0, RSTART+9, RLENGTH-9)
		p=""
		if (match($0, /redirect to :[0-9]+/)) p=substr($0, RSTART+13, RLENGTH-13)
		else if (match($0, /dnat to [^ ]*:[0-9]+/)) { s=substr($0, RSTART, RLENGTH); sub(/.*:/, "", s); p=s }
		if (p != "" && p != "53") print fam" "tbl" "ch" "h" "p
	}' | while read -r fam tbl ch h p; do
	[ -n "$fam" ] && [ -n "$tbl" ] && [ -n "$ch" ] && [ -n "$h" ] || continue
	if ! netstat -lntu 2>/dev/null | grep -q ":$p "; then
		nft delete rule "$fam" "$tbl" "$ch" handle "$h" 2>/dev/null && echo "removed $p"
	fi
done > /tmp/gwrt-dns-rescue.nft 2>/dev/null
if [ -s /tmp/gwrt-dns-rescue.nft ]; then
	cnt=$(wc -l < /tmp/gwrt-dns-rescue.nft)
	act "清理 $cnt 条指向死端口的 DNS 重定向规则"
fi
rm -f /tmp/gwrt-dns-rescue.nft

# ---------- 5. 重启 dnsmasq 并自检 ----------
/etc/init.d/dnsmasq enabled 2>/dev/null || /etc/init.d/dnsmasq enable 2>/dev/null
/etc/init.d/dnsmasq restart >/dev/null 2>&1
sleep 2

# dnsmasq 重启会重建 /tmp/resolv.conf；保险起见再检查一次
if ! grep -q '^nameserver 127.0.0.1' /tmp/resolv.conf 2>/dev/null; then
	printf 'search lan\nnameserver 127.0.0.1\nnameserver ::1\n' > /tmp/resolv.conf
	act "补写 /tmp/resolv.conf"
fi

if pidof dnsmasq >/dev/null 2>&1; then
	act "dnsmasq 已运行"
else
	wrn "dnsmasq 未在运行"
fi

p53=$(netstat -tlnp 2>/dev/null | awk '/:53 /{print $7; exit}')
case "$p53" in
	*dnsmasq*) ;;
	"") wrn "53 端口无监听" ;;
	*) wrn "53 端口被非 dnsmasq 进程占用 ($p53)" ;;
esac

if nslookup www.baidu.com 127.0.0.1 >/dev/null 2>&1; then
	ip=$(nslookup www.baidu.com 127.0.0.1 2>/dev/null | awk '/^Address: /{print $2; exit}')
	TESTMSG="解析正常（www.baidu.com → ${ip:-ok}）"
	OK=1
else
	TESTMSG="解析仍失败"
	wrn "自检解析失败：请检查 WAN 连接或上游 DNS"
fi

printf '{"ok":%s,"actions":[%s],"warnings":[%s],"test":"%s"}\n' \
	"$([ "$OK" -eq 1 ] && echo true || echo false)" "$ACTIONS" "$WARNINGS" "$(jesc "$TESTMSG")"
exit 0
